		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  [ORA2PG] GOTO instruction]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=28160#p28160"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Nn il ne la gère pas. J&#039;ai aussi ce problème.<br />Le GOTO n&#039;existe pas sous Postgres.</p><p>Savez-vous comment migrer ce code&#160; :</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; begin <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; select &#039;COUPE&#039;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; into STRICT&#160; tpcray<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; from cr<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; where segment = ncray;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; goto maj_delta;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;exception<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; when no_data_found then null;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; when others&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; then return null;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; end;</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; tpcray := &#039;OK&#039;;</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; ------------------------------------<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; -- Mise a jour de la valeur delta --<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; ------------------------------------</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &lt;&lt;maj_delta&gt;&gt;</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; if(tpcray = &#039;KO&#039;)&#160; then delta := 10;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; end if;</p><br /><p>Merci d&#039;avance.</p>]]></content>
